{"id":71257,"date":"2026-10-28T16:45:37","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T16:45:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71257"},"modified":"2026-10-28T17:47:40","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T16:47:40","slug":"bonito-christmas-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/bonito-christmas-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Bonito Christmas Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Bonito Christmas Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Bonito Christmas Trail 2026<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no dia <strong>29 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (domingo), com centro log\u00edstico, partidas e chegadas no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Entroncamento<\/strong>, no concelho do <strong>Entroncamento<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Integrado no calend\u00e1rio competitivo do <strong>CTR \u2013 Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo<\/strong> e no <strong>Campeonato Regional de Santar\u00e9m de Trail Sprint<\/strong> (Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m), o evento alia a competi\u00e7\u00e3o nos trilhos ribatejanos ao esp\u00edrito festivo da quadra natal\u00edcia.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa desportivo desenrola-se na envolvente natural do <strong>Parque Verde do Bonito<\/strong> e nas paisagens rurais da cidade ferrovi\u00e1ria do <strong>Entroncamento<\/strong>, apresentando quatro op\u00e7\u00f5es ajustadas a diferentes n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o: o <strong>Trail de 25 km<\/strong> (cerca de <strong>500m D+<\/strong>) e o <strong>Trail Curto de 16 km<\/strong> (cerca de <strong>300m D+<\/strong>), ambos com partida conjunta \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, seguidos \u00e0s <strong>09:30<\/strong> pelo <strong>Mini Trail de 12 km<\/strong> a correr e pela <strong>Caminhada de 12 km<\/strong> (ambos com cerca de <strong>200m D+<\/strong>).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>CLAC \u2013 Clube de Lazer, Aventura e Competi\u00e7\u00e3o do Entroncamento<\/strong>, a prova assegura cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, buff oficial alusivo ao evento, pr\u00e9mio finisher para todos os participantes, balne\u00e1rios para banhos e possibilidade de alojamento em regime de solo duro no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Entroncamento na v\u00e9spera da competi\u00e7\u00e3o. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">29 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Entroncamento, Entroncamento, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\