font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/09 a 31\/10\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/11 a 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do Bonito Christmas Trail 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Bonito Christmas Trail 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Entroncamento (Rua J\u00falio Dinis). O Trail 25 km e o Trail Curto 16 km partem \u00e0s 09:00, enquanto o Mini Trail 12 km e a Caminhada 12 km partem \u00e0s 09:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, altimetrias e circuitos oficiais da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento inclui o Trail de 25 km (500m D+, pontu\u00e1vel para o Circuito de Trail do CTR \u2013 Circuito de Trail do Ribatejo), o Trail Curto de 16 km (300m D+, pontu\u00e1vel para o Circuito de Trail Curto do CTR e Campeonato Regional de Santar\u00e9m de Trail Sprint da AA Santar\u00e9m) e os 12 km a Correr (Mini Trail) ou a Caminhar (200m D+).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Bonito Christmas Trail 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem em 3 fases (15 a 31 de agosto; 1 de setembro a 31 de outubro; e 1 a 15 de novembro de 2026): o Trail 25 km custa 17,00 \u20ac \/ 20,00 \u20ac \/ 23,00 \u20ac; o Trail Curto 16 km custa 15,00 \u20ac \/ 18,00 \u20ac \/ 20,00 \u20ac; e o Mini Trail 12 km e a Caminhada 12 km custam 12,00 \u20ac \/ 14,00 \u20ac \/ 15,00 \u20ac. H\u00e1 op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio por 8,00 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o inclu\u00eddos na inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Entroncamento no s\u00e1bado, 28 de novembro (17:00 \u00e0s 20:00, com rece\u00e7\u00e3o para solo duro), e no domingo, 29 de novembro (07:00 \u00e0s 08:30). A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui peitoral personalizado, buff alusivo \u00e0 prova, pr\u00e9mio finisher, abastecimentos, seguro desportivo e banhos nos balne\u00e1rios do pavilh\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos participantes?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Por motivos de seguran\u00e7a e auto-sufici\u00eancia (a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o fornece copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento), \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel operacional, sistema pr\u00f3prio de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o\/\u00e1gua (porta-bidon, camelbak ou copo), manta t\u00e9rmica e apito.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Bonito Christmas Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Entroncamento\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Entroncamento\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Bonito Christmas Trail 2026 realiza-se a 29 de novembro no Entroncamento. Provas de Trail 25 km, 16 km, Mini Trail e Caminhada 12 km. Inscreve-te j\u00e1 aqui!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-bonito-christmas-trail.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail 25K (Circuito CTR Ribatejo)\", \"price\": \"20.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.queroir.pt\/evento\/bonitochristmastrail2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 16K (CTR & Camp. Regional Trail Sprint)\", \"price\": \"18.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.queroir.pt\/evento\/bonitochristmastrail2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Trail 12K (12 km a Correr)\", \"price\": \"14.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.queroir.pt\/evento\/bonitochristmastrail2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 12K\", \"price\": \"14.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.queroir.pt\/evento\/bonitochristmastrail2026\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"CLAC \u2013 Clube de Lazer, Aventura e Competi\u00e7\u00e3o do Entroncamento\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida do Bonito Christmas Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Bonito Christmas Trail 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal do Entroncamento (Rua J\u00falio Dinis). O Trail 25 km e o Trail Curto 16 km partem \u00e0s 09:00, enquanto o Mini Trail 12 km e a Caminhada 12 km partem \u00e0s 09:30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Questi